---
description: >-
  A two-lane Intake/Review cycle with a retry loop (fix issues going back
  into task), rendered left-to-right in the handDrawn look with an
  increased minNodeWidth.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  look: handDrawn
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    useMaxWidth: false
    minNodeWidth: 200
---
swimlane-beta LR
  subgraph Intake
  start([Start])
  task[Do work]
  fix[Fix issues]
  end

  subgraph Review
  decision{Ready?}
  end


  start --> task --> decision
  decision -->|No| fix
  fix --> task
